    {
     "media": "",
     "content": "<p><span style=\"color: rgb(34, 34, 34);\">This 4.5K community run is all about moving together.</span></p><p><br></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(34, 34, 34);\">Designed at an easy, social pace, this run welcomes all fitness levels. Whether you’re a regular runner or just getting started, this one’s for the Glow Gang that shows up for movement, connection, and good energy.</span></p><p><br></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(34, 34, 34);\">We start with a group warm-up to get bodies ready, then head out on a relaxed city route where conversation flows as easily as the run. The session wraps up with a guided cool-down, so you leave feeling refreshed, reset, and fully in your glow.</span></p><p><br></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(34, 34, 34);\">No pressure on pace. No competition. Just a good run with good people.</span></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(34, 34, 34);\">Date: 15th Feb, Saturday</span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(34, 34, 34);\">Location: Westside – Commercial Street → Ulsoor Lake → SUFC Turf</span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(34, 34, 34);\">Time: 6:45am (reporting), 7am (flag off)</span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(34, 34, 34);\">﻿</span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(34, 34, 34);\">Let’s clock the vibes&nbsp;<img src=\"https://fonts.gstatic.com/s/e/notoemoji/16.0/1f496/32.png\" alt=\"💖\"></span></p>"
